## User Role Values
```
Role.Backoffice = 0
Role.StationOperator = 1
```

## Booking Status Values
```
0 = Pending (awaiting approval)
1 = Approved (QR code generated)
2 = Rejected (with reason)
3 = Completed (charging finished)
4 = Cancelled (by user)
5 = Active (currently charging)
```

## Error Response Format
```json
{
  "message": "Detailed error description"
}
```

## Complete API Endpoints Summary

### Authentication & User Management
```
POST /api/auth/login                           # System user login
GET  /api/auth/profile                        # Get system user profile
POST /api/auth/register                       # Legacy user creation (Backoffice token required)
POST /api/auth/create-backoffice-user         # Create backoffice user (PUBLIC - NO TOKEN)
POST /api/auth/create-station-operator        # Create station operator (PUBLIC - NO TOKEN)
```

### EV Owner Self-Service
```
POST /api/evownerauth/register                # EV owner self-registration
POST /api/evownerauth/login                   # EV owner login
GET  /api/evownerauth/profile                 # Get EV owner profile
PUT  /api/evownerauth/profile                 # Update EV owner profile
POST /api/evownerauth/deactivate              # Self-deactivate account
POST /api/evownerauth/reactivate/{nic}        # Reactivate account (Backoffice only)
```

### EV Owner Management (Backoffice)
```
POST /api/evowners                            # Create EV owner (profile only)
POST /api/evowners/create-with-password       # Create EV owner with login
GET  /api/evowners                            # Get all EV owners 🆕
GET  /api/evowners/active                     # Get active EV owners 🆕
GET  /api/evowners/inactive                   # Get inactive EV owners 🆕
GET  /api/evowners/{nic}                      # Get specific EV owner
PUT  /api/evowners/{nic}                      # Update EV owner
DELETE /api/evowners/{nic}                    # Delete EV owner
POST /api/evowners/{nic}/activate             # Activate EV owner
POST /api/evowners/{nic}/deactivate           # Deactivate EV owner
POST /api/evowners/{nic}/reactivate           # Reactivate EV owner
```

### Charging Station Management
```
POST /api/chargingstations                    # Create station (Backoffice)
GET  /api/chargingstations                    # Get all stations
GET  /api/chargingstations/active             # Get active stations
